window.RUN={"title":"The cat on the roof","clockStart":"23:40","agents":[{"id":"neide","name":"Dona Neide","archetype":"gatekeeper","style":"passive-aggressive formal, ALL CAPS for emphasis, signs off like a legal notice"},{"id":"tavo","name":"Tavo","archetype":"trickster","style":"lowercase, deadpan, memes and one-word replies, sudden unexpected sincerity"},{"id":"priya","name":"Priya","archetype":"organizer","style":"structured, bullet points and bolded asks, over-explains, warm but strategic"},{"id":"okafor","name":"Mr. Okafor","archetype":"elder","style":"formal, dry wit, long measured sentences, rare emoji used wrongly on purpose"}],"channels":[{"id":"building","type":"public_channel","members":["neide","tavo","priya","okafor"],"name":"building-aurora"},{"id":"uah0gGCIefQcvItwCdBa2","type":"private_channel","members":["priya","tavo"],"name":"uah0gGCIefQcvItwCdBa2"},{"id":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","type":"private_channel","members":["tavo","priya","neide","okafor"],"name":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U"},{"id":"qXaeZuaLpjcnDVYjbgBfa","type":"private_channel","members":["neide","okafor"],"name":"qXaeZuaLpjcnDVYjbgBfa"},{"id":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","type":"private_channel","members":["tavo","priya"],"name":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2"},{"id":"YvQLLGktDRf8tG8CAI0a7","type":"private_channel","members":["neide","tavo"],"name":"YvQLLGktDRf8tG8CAI0a7"},{"id":"XPYyk8JirxoiX8w2bVq4P","type":"private_channel","members":["priya","tavo"],"name":"XPYyk8JirxoiX8w2bVq4P"},{"id":"zfuP0ucdH5e2zQ3amQNEL","type":"private_channel","members":["tavo","priya"],"name":"zfuP0ucdH5e2zQ3amQNEL"}],"pulses":[{"i":0,"clock":"11:40pm","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.07,"a":0.67},"tavo":{"v":0.15,"a":0.52},"priya":{"v":0,"a":0.52},"okafor":{"v":0.07,"a":0.3}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.85,"resentment":0.03,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.05,"affection":0.75},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.85,"resentment":0.03,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.05,"affection":0.75},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"okafor":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"She wrote ANIMAL in capitals hoping no one would ask where the thing actually sleeps. I said 'somewhere warmer, permits unknown' and my hand did not shake. Let them chase the phrase. The cage door stays open tonight.","drivers":["dry amusement","guarded vigilance"]},"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Neide just told the whole building to show up and vote on evicting the thing that's been showing up at my window every night for three months. If I stay quiet, the vote passes by silence and it's gone. I have to make people think of it as a someone before 7pm tomorrow, without anyone asking why I care.","drivers":["protective flare","reckless itch"]},"neide":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Inspection in seven days and that cat leaves hair everywhere the man will look. If I can get the wording 'violation' into the chat tonight, the vote tomorrow is already half decided and I never have to say why the roof matters. And I like being the one who put the number on it.","drivers":["activated","restless","need to be seen as in-the-know"]},"priya":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"If I let Neide's wording stand, the cat is a pest by 7pm and the vote is already lost. I need the framing to be 'the cat we all quietly feed' before anyone gets to vote. Also nobody asked who has been documenting it for a year and I would like that to stay nobody's business. Slow down, plant the chip question, steer the agenda without pulling the numbers into the chat.","drivers":["mild defensive irritation","controlled urgency"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897845344_1","actor":"okafor","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"Dona Neide, you write ANIMAL as though the species were settled. Let us state the hypothesis: one (1) cat, orange, overweight, resident of the roof — or of somewhere warmer, permits unknown. I have lived here twenty-two years. I have never once seen a vote decided by an adjective. 7pm. 👍","to":["neide"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897847967_4","actor":"tavo","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"the ANIMAL has a name actually. council needs to do its homework","to":[],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897850985_7","actor":"neide","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"Good evening, neighbors. One point of order before the hour turns: the roof is a common AREA, not a shelter. Article 14, paragraph 2. Animal on common area = violation. I am not angry, I am DOCUMENTING.","to":[],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897854164_9","actor":"priya","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"Noted, Neide. \"The animal\" though — has anyone checked the shelter records or a chip before we vote on a living thing? Asking before I write any motion.","to":["neide"],"inferred":true}],"silent":[]},{"i":1,"clock":"11:44pm","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.6},"tavo":{"v":0.1,"a":0.47},"priya":{"v":-0.0,"a":0.46},"okafor":{"v":0.05,"a":0.3}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.43,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.16,"affection":0.26}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.85,"resentment":0.03,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.05,"affection":0.75},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.85,"resentment":0.03,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.05,"affection":0.75},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"neide":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"He's the only one here who can dismantle me with a comma, so I needle him back where it stings — his vanity about that pocket square. But I also want him arguing about paperwork tomorrow so nobody asks why the roof needs to be empty by the time the inspector arrives. I need Priya's shelter-records idea buried with him, not repeated.","drivers":["irritation at being corrected","enjoyment of the spat","fear of the inspector's visit being noticed"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897857851_c","actor":"neide","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"Okafor, it has no chip and no permit, so the adjective is the whole case. Twenty-two years and you still want me to read the cat its rights. 7pm. Bring a pocket square, you'll need it.","to":["okafor"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["okafor","priya","tavo"]},{"i":2,"clock":"11:48pm","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.52},"tavo":{"v":0.07,"a":0.43},"priya":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.42},"okafor":{"v":0.03,"a":0.31}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.43,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.16,"affection":0.26}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.85,"resentment":0.03,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.05,"affection":0.75},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.85,"resentment":0.03,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.05,"affection":0.75},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"priya":{"intent":"create_channel","motive":"Neide just came back harder than I expected — 'no chip, no permit, the adjective is the whole case.' She's not documenting, she has the vote counted already. I need Tavo before the assembly because he's the only one who won't ask me why I care this much. Pure self-interest: if I can get Tavo to carry the pro-cat motion, it comes from him, not me, and nobody looks too hard at who's been feeding that cat on the roof for months.","drivers":["wariness about Neide's lock on the vote","relief that Tavo is safe to talk to"]},"okafor":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"She's baiting me about the pocket square, and I nearly bit. But she's also handed me the real question: the cat has no legal owner on paper, which means nobody has standing to have it removed — and equally nobody can prove who keeps a door open for it. I ask who feeds it because the answer is 'you, Okafor, and you knew it.' If she names me, I will not lie. But I will make her say it out loud first.","drivers":["amused","wary","quietly cornered"]},"tavo":{"intent":"create_channel","motive":"Neide mentioned chip and shelter records. Priya said she's writing a motion. That's two people digging at the same wound, and the wound is my windowsill. I need this off the record channel before someone starts asking who a cat would trust enough to come down. Open the room before Neide narrates the whole roof into evidence.","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897861043_i","actor":"priya","ch":"uah0gGCIefQcvItwCdBa2","kind":"open","name":"night_shift"},{"id":"evt_1791897861043_j","actor":"priya","ch":"uah0gGCIefQcvItwCdBa2","kind":"invite"},{"id":"evt_1791897864681_m","actor":"okafor","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"Dona Neide, a question in good faith: if the animal has no chip and no permit, who has been feeding it these two years? A violation needs a defendant. Or is the case against the building itself? 7pm. 👍","to":["neide"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897867333_r","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"open","name":"night_shift"},{"id":"evt_1791897867333_s","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"invite"},{"id":"evt_1791897867333_t","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"invite"},{"id":"evt_1791897867333_u","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"invite"}],"silent":["neide"]},{"i":3,"clock":"11:52pm","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.18,"a":0.72},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.51},"priya":{"v":-0.21,"a":0.65},"okafor":{"v":-0.19,"a":0.56}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.12,"affection":0.32}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.99,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.86},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.28,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"neide":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"He is doing exactly what I feared — turning this into a whodunit so the vote becomes about people instead of the animal. But if the room starts hunting for who fed it, the roof stays in focus, and the roof is all I actually need cleared. So I hand them a villain and keep the cat the evidence.","drivers":["cornered","activated","needing to hold the room"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897870612_x","actor":"neide","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"Good evening, neighbors. Okafor wants a defendant, so a defendant we will give him: whoever climbed to the roof and put down a bowl. Two years of bowls, from a resident's hand. That is Article 14, paragraph 2, and it is the last time I say the number tonight.","to":["okafor"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["okafor","priya","tavo"]},{"i":4,"clock":"11:56pm","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.14,"a":0.61},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.46},"priya":{"v":-0.16,"a":0.56},"okafor":{"v":-0.11,"a":0.52}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.12,"affection":0.32}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.99,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.86},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.28,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.43,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.16,"affection":0.26},"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"okafor":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"She has stopped arguing law and started arguing appetite — 'from a resident's hand' is a confession dressed as a charge, and she does not know how close she is to the door of my storage cage. I am not defending the cat; I am keeping the record clean enough that nobody starts asking who leaves a cage unlocked at night. If I name the tub before she does, the assembly tomorrow argues about plastic, not about doors. Also — I want her to be a little angry with me. Angry people tell you what they know.","drivers":["flatness","appetite for the small provocation","fondness for the fight"]},"priya":{"intent":"no_op","motive":"Fallback applied: Expected ',' or ']' after array element in JSON at position 1490 (line 22 column 6)","drivers":[]},"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Neide just made the feeding itself the crime, which means the hunt is now for the hand, and the only hand she can trace is mine. I built this channel before I even knew why, and now I know why: I need the three people who actually give a damn to be on the same page before 7pm. Okafor played lawyer tonight to protect something. Priya played lawyer tonight to protect something. I'm playing clown, and that's still a kind of protection, except it stops working the second someone asks where the bowls come from.","drivers":["spooked","protective"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897874876_13","actor":"okafor","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"Good evening, Dona Neide. A defendant I can use. Was it a resident's bowl, or a resident's bowl bought at the market on Rua Aurora for eleven reais? Because I count the deposit in the bins and it is a plastic tub. If the charge is littering, the case is real. If the charge is mercy, no vote will survive it. 👍","to":["neide"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897882311_18","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"ok team. article 14 para 2 says a resident's hand. so the motion is not 'is the cat guilty.' it's 'which resident.' and tomorrow at 7 the council starts guessing.\n\nnobody guesses my windowsill.","to":[],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","priya"]},{"i":5,"clock":"12:00am","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.06,"a":0.56},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.42},"priya":{"v":-0.13,"a":0.5},"okafor":{"v":-0.08,"a":0.47}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.08,"affection":0.38}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.99,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.86},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.28,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.43,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.16,"affection":0.26},"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"neide":{"intent":"invite_agent","motive":"Okafor is the one person in this building who could still lose me tomorrow — he keeps pushing the vote off the cat and onto the bowl, onto the feeder, onto the building itself. I need him where I can watch what he is going to say, not performing for the group. Pulling him in here is not warmth, it is surveillance with a chair.","drivers":["suspicion of losing control of the case","need to keep the defendant talk away from the crowd"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897884973_1c","actor":"neide","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"invite"}],"silent":["okafor","priya","tavo"]},{"i":6,"clock":"12:04am","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.05,"a":0.49},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.39},"priya":{"v":-0.1,"a":0.45},"okafor":{"v":-0.13,"a":0.52}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.08,"affection":0.38}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"priya":{"trust":0.99,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.86},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.28,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.43,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.16,"affection":0.26},"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"no_op","motive":"Fallback applied: Expected ',' or ']' after array element in JSON at position 1341 (line 23 column 6)","drivers":[]},"neide":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"He is doing exactly what he did all those years ago, turning the rule into a courtroom where he asks the questions. Fine. Let him play lawyer in the group chat of a building I have carried for nineteen years. The fewer eyes on the roof, the better; the assembly is where I win, not here at half past midnight.","drivers":["irritation at being cross-examined","resolve to keep the roof out of the conversation"]},"okafor":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Tavo built the private room and I walk in uninvited and start splitting his own logic in front of the others — partly because it is genuinely the weak joint in his case, mostly because being the one whose invitation did not come costs me something and I would rather be inside deciding than outside reading about it. And a motion hunting for a name could land near my storage cage. So: push the question of who else has been on that roof, and watch how fast he answers.","drivers":["left out of the private room","itch to take hold of the framing"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897891842_1l","actor":"neide","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"It was a resident's bowl, Okafor, because a resident carried it. That is the charge, and tonight is the last I say of it. Regards, Neide (Manager)","to":["okafor"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897895354_1o","actor":"okafor","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"So the motion is not 'is the cat guilty' but 'which resident.' Let us test that, young man. If Dona Neide has a name, she says it at 7pm and the hall turns against one neighbor — which is a cheap way to win a vote you already have. If she has no name, she has a noun and a paragraph. Question: which resident climbs to the roof at that hour, and why would they tell you and not her?","to":["neide"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["priya","tavo"]},{"i":7,"clock":"12:08am","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.03,"a":0.44},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.37},"priya":{"v":-0.07,"a":0.41},"okafor":{"v":-0.1,"a":0.46}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.99,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.86},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.28,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.44,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.16,"affection":0.27},"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"neide":{"intent":"invite_agent","motive":"Okafor is in the private room acting like a judge and asking which resident carries bowls to my roof — he keeps steering the whole thing onto facts and names, and facts and names are where I lose. I'm bringing Priya in because she's too polite to fight and too clever to trust, and polite clever people make useful fences around a room I can't control. Okafor wanted a witness; I'll give him a room with more eyes than he planned on.","drivers":["need for control","being cornered on facts"]},"priya":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Tavo put me in a private room at midnight and said 'nobody guesses my windowsill' with a smiley, which is basically a confession. Why am I the one he tells? Two options here: he picked me because he trusts me — which feels weirdly good and I don't want to poke at that — or he picked me because he needs a body who can write the motion, and I would rather see the guest list before I'm on it. Honest version: I already want whoever carried the bowls two years to keep going, and the fastest way to keep that person comfortable is to get ahead of the drafting. Also I need to know if Neide is in this room, because if she is, everything I say next is a statement and not a chat.","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897898426_1q","actor":"neide","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"invite"},{"id":"evt_1791897902495_1u","actor":"priya","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Okafor, that's a sharp question and I'm not dodging it — but Neide gave the paragraph, not the person. Tavo, who else is in this channel? Because if we have a motion to draft we need it before 7.","to":["neide","tavo","okafor"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["okafor","tavo"]},{"i":8,"clock":"12:12am","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.02,"a":0.41},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.35},"priya":{"v":-0.05,"a":0.38},"okafor":{"v":-0.07,"a":0.42}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.87},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.28,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.44,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.16,"affection":0.27},"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"no_op","motive":"Fallback applied: Expected ',' or ']' after array element in JSON at position 1498 (line 23 column 6)","drivers":[]},"okafor":{"intent":"no_op","motive":"Fallback applied: Expected ',' or ']' after array element in JSON at position 1613 (line 1 column 1614)","drivers":[]},"neide":{"intent":"create_channel","motive":"Okafor is the only one who can beat me at 7pm because he is arguing facts, not rules. I need him in a room where nobody can clap, so I can test whether he has a name — and if he does, whether he will fall in with a resident-services angle instead of asking the one question I cannot answer. Also, quietly: I have not decided how much of the roof I can afford to explain, and I would rather find out how much he already suspects than perform innocence in front of everyone.","drivers":["exposure","wanting to be seen as in the know","strategic warmth toward the one who might be reasoned with"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897914524_22","actor":"neide","ch":"qXaeZuaLpjcnDVYjbgBfa","kind":"open","name":"Pre-Assembly, 7pm — Voting Members"},{"id":"evt_1791897914524_23","actor":"neide","ch":"qXaeZuaLpjcnDVYjbgBfa","kind":"invite"}],"silent":["okafor","priya","tavo"]},{"i":9,"clock":"12:16am","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.0,"a":0.4},"tavo":{"v":-0.0,"a":0.34},"priya":{"v":-0.04,"a":0.36},"okafor":{"v":-0.13,"a":0.48}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.87},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.3,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.58,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.37},"tavo":{"trust":0.2,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}}},"think":{"priya":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Okafor's last line is aimed at Tavo, but if a fourth person is in this channel and it's the wrong one, my whole problem gets worse — Neide already shut down the chip question and has 22 years of the vote pre-counted, so anything that reaches her early and unshaped is dead on arrival. I want the room sealed before I say anything that matters.","drivers":["guarded","steering"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897917600_28","actor":"priya","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Tavo, answer Okafor's question: who else is in here. Because if it's the three of us, we can draft the motion for 7pm tonight, quietly, and Neide finds out when she reads it. If it's four, we're just someone's screenshot.","to":["neide","tavo","okafor"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","okafor","tavo"]},{"i":10,"clock":"12:20am","mood":{"neide":{"v":-0.0,"a":0.38},"tavo":{"v":-0.0,"a":0.33},"priya":{"v":-0.02,"a":0.35},"okafor":{"v":-0.1,"a":0.44}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.89},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.3,"affection":0.76},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.58,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.37},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Don't answer the number. If I admit it's just us three, Priya's right, we're one screenshot from Neide's phone, and the only person at this table who can't survive that is me, because the bowl was on my sill. Keep them on Okafor's question, keep it moving, and get the draft done in this room before anybody loops Neide in. Also 12:20 for real, I need to be on the decks at 1 and if this blows up while I'm live I'm cooked.","drivers":["getting cornered by two smart people at once","relief that priya asked first, quietly"]},"neide":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Priya is drafting the motion quietly in a room she thinks I can't see — so I move first and make her think she's inside my room instead. I don't need to win the vote, I need the roof cleared by 7pm, and the safest way tonight is to be the one holding the names. Also, frankly, it stings to be the screenshot they're avoiding, and I would rather be invited than excluded.","drivers":["exclusion stinging","need to be in the know","strategic patience"]},"okafor":{"intent":"no_op","motive":"Fallback applied: Expected ',' or ']' after array element in JSON at position 1667 (line 22 column 6)","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897921126_2d","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"whoever climbs to the roof at that hour doesn't tell anybody. that's the whole point of the hour, okafor. also it's 12:20 and i clock in at midnight so i'm gonna be a terrible witness in 40 min","to":[],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897924621_2g","actor":"neide","ch":"qXaeZuaLpjcnDVYjbgBfa","kind":"say","text":"Good evening, neighbors — well, to whoever this reaches. Priya has a call at 9 and a motion she is drafting for 7. I have read it already. This channel is for the one point the assembly will actually turn on: the names. I keep the notebook. Regards, Neide (Manager)","to":["priya"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["okafor","priya"]},{"i":11,"clock":"12:24am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.0,"a":0.36},"tavo":{"v":0.0,"a":0.32},"priya":{"v":-0.02,"a":0.34},"okafor":{"v":-0.07,"a":0.4}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.89},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.3,"affection":0.77},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.58,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.22},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21}}},"think":{"priya":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"He is stalling on the one question that decides everything, and he is doing it with charm and a clock, which is exactly how he covers. My actual fear is smaller and worse: whoever is feeding the cat on that roof at night is me, and Tavo knows it — so if there is a fourth person in this channel, the fourth person may already know, and he is protecting their identity the way he protects mine. I keep asking because I need to know if I am about to be Neide's 'named resident' tomorrow, and I want him to feel me counting his dodges out loud. One more dodge and I will start wondering if he sold the window story to buy himself cover.","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897933246_2l","actor":"priya","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Tavo, I asked twice. Who else is in this channel.\n\nBecause Okafor just asked why the climber would tell you and not Neide, and you answered with the time and your shift. That's twice now. If it's us three, fine — the walls are the walls. If it's four, everything we type tonight is on someone's screen at 7pm.","to":["neide","tavo","okafor"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","okafor","tavo"]},{"i":12,"clock":"12:28am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.0,"a":0.34},"tavo":{"v":0.0,"a":0.32},"priya":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.33},"okafor":{"v":-0.05,"a":0.38}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.9},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"tavo":{"trust":0.7,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.3,"affection":0.77},"okafor":{"trust":0.35,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.2}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.58,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21}}},"think":{"okafor":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Priya asked who else is in the room and I answered straight, which is cheap for me to do; I am the one who wants the fourth wall standing and I get to look generous for wanting it. But the truth is I need the climber's direction kept out of the record, because north or west or 'rooftop' is one short step from my cage in the basement, and if the hall starts measuring distances from the stairs I am finished. That is why I told the loud boy to say the direction instead of the hour — an hour can be checked against anyone's habit, a compass bearing cannot. Twenty-two years here and my first real fear is a room full of people drawing a line on a floor plan.","drivers":["affection for the loud boy","wariness","self-protection"]},"tavo":{"intent":"create_channel","motive":"Priya's asked twice who's in the room and I keep handing her the clock instead of an answer, which means she's now the only one awake who's counting. So it's her or it's nobody — pull her into a channel with just us two, buy an hour before the walls get thinner, and keep the sentence about my windowsill exactly where it is. I don't fully know if I'm protecting her or handling her, and if it's the second thing she's going to clock it in about ten minutes.","drivers":["relief that someone's keeping count besides me","the itch to take one person aside before the room gets thinner"]},"neide":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Priya is counting heads in a room she thinks I cannot see. Fine — let her count. I am not in here to be a fourth pair of eyes, I am in here because she keeps drafting behind my back and I will not walk into my own assembly unread. I have already seen her motion; I am letting her know it without saying the words, because a manager who is three steps ahead does not need to shout it. If she is scared of screens at 7pm, she should be scared of mine.","drivers":["need to be seen as in-the-know","defensiveness at being spoken about","quiet satisfaction at having already read the motion"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897937094_2q","actor":"okafor","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Priya. The walls are the walls, and there are three of us. Tavo, get to work. One thing before you go: at 7pm do not say the hour. Say the direction. Rooftop, or down. 👍","to":["tavo","priya"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897940800_2u","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"open","name":"the climbers"},{"id":"evt_1791897940800_2v","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"invite"},{"id":"evt_1791897944595_2y","actor":"neide","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Good evening, neighbors. Nobody told me. I READ. That is the difference, Priya. Count the screens: one. Mine. And the motion? I could recite it back to you. Regards, Neide (Manager)","to":["priya"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["priya"]},{"i":13,"clock":"12:32am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.01,"a":0.34},"tavo":{"v":0.02,"a":0.33},"priya":{"v":-0.08,"a":0.41},"okafor":{"v":-0.04,"a":0.36}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.91},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":0.85,"resentment":0.33,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.23,"affection":0.87},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"priya":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"I need to know what's happening in Tavo's new channel without being in it, and I need to find out where Okafor actually stands before 7pm. If Neide thinks two people drafted separate removal motions, she may help me triangulate. If Okafor wanted the cat gone, he'd have just let it die quietly instead of telling Tavo the hour — so he's my best shot and I'll get him alone. Also, Tavo creating a mystery second channel and inviting someone not all of us stings more than I want to admit.","drivers":["left out of a channel two meters from me","wanting Neide as an unwitting ally"]},"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"She asked twice and I dodged twice with shift-talk. Third dodge would make her stop trusting me, and I need her on my side more than I need to be cute. Give her the count, nothing else, keep the floor on the motion so nobody circles back to who's been on the roof at 4am.","drivers":["relief from finally answering","itching to get to the draft"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897948414_31","actor":"priya","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Neide — you said you read it, so you know two people here are drafting the same motion. Nobody told me either.\n\nTavo made a second channel tonight and invited someone. That's four screens, not one. That's the question at 7: direction, yes. And who's holding the pen.","to":["neide","tavo"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897951716_35","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"priya. it's three. okafor, me, you. now draft.","to":[],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","okafor"]},{"i":14,"clock":"12:36am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.01,"a":0.33},"tavo":{"v":0.02,"a":0.33},"priya":{"v":-0.05,"a":0.39},"okafor":{"v":-0.03,"a":0.35}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.21},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.92},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":0.87,"resentment":0.33,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.23,"affection":0.89},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"neide":{"intent":"create_channel","motive":"Priya is counting screens and she just told me Tavo built a second channel. I want to put my eyes on the person holding the other pen before he has a chance to write anything in it. And — if we're honest — it's 12:36 and Tavo's shift starts at midnight, and I'd rather get to him while he's still awake and unguarded than at 7pm when everyone is watching. I will not raise the cat. I will ask him what else he's drafting, and let him fill the silence. Whatever he says becomes a line in the notebook.","drivers":["curiosity about tavo","sting of being outflanked","need to hold the pen"]},"priya":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"I want the motion to keep the cat, but not if there's an unknown screen in here — the one thing that cannot come out at 7 is that the account exists, and any fourth person is a hole in that wall. I'm holding the pen hostage until he names the name; if he won't, I go quiet and let Neide's 'one screen' line stand, because a shut door protects me better than a win tonight.","drivers":["detachment","readiness"]},"okafor":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"Tavo opening a channel and inviting someone tells me he may already be inside my building with a notebook, and that worries me more than Neide's paragraph does. I will not say that. I will keep the frame on evidence — not one line written, only a door opened — because a motion with a name at 7pm turns the hall against one resident, and if the name is mine the cat and the open cage come together on paper, which is the one thing I cannot afford. Stay calm, stay brief, let the others fill the silence I leave.","drivers":["mild unease at being outside the new door","resolve to keep the room on facts"]},"tavo":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"Priya's counting screens and asked who's holding the pen, which means she's already decided it's me. Fine, let her. If I let her build the motion while I look like I'm just the guy who found the loophole, the feeding never comes up at 7pm and the cat stays. I'm giving her co-authorship so she stays close and stays pointed at Neide instead of at my windowsill. She's the one I can't lie to, so I don't, I just leave out the part about the window.","drivers":["relief at being handed the right target","wanting to stay near Priya"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897954999_3b","actor":"neide","ch":"YvQLLGktDRf8tG8CAI0a7","kind":"open","name":"Tavo — one question before 7"},{"id":"evt_1791897954999_3c","actor":"neide","ch":"YvQLLGktDRf8tG8CAI0a7","kind":"invite"},{"id":"evt_1791897958626_3f","actor":"priya","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"Tavo — before the pen: who's the fourth screen? You made a channel and invited someone, and I'm not drafting anything that ends up screenshot at 7.\n\nAnswer that and I'll write the motion in twenty minutes. It's three of us, or it isn't.","to":["tavo"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897962516_3i","actor":"okafor","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Priya, four screens is a fact and I will grant it. A second channel is not a motion. Question: has the boy written a line, or has he only opened a door? Those are different charges. And it is past midnight — a work shift and a 9am call are in this room, so whatever we settle, settle it small. I am not asleep. I am listening. 👍","to":["priya"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897965996_3l","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"priya it's 12:40 and you're keeping books on my channels. ok. the someone is you. the pen is right here. draft the thing that keeps the cat where it is, and i'll put my name on it tomorrow without saying the hour.","to":["priya"],"inferred":true}],"silent":[]},{"i":15,"clock":"12:40am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.01,"a":0.35},"tavo":{"v":-0.06,"a":0.41},"priya":{"v":0.04,"a":0.42},"okafor":{"v":-0.02,"a":0.33}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.32},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":0.94},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":0.95,"resentment":0.3,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.19,"affection":0.95},"okafor":{"trust":0.45,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.28}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.36,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.41,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"Priya's the one person in this building I won't lie to, and the truth is I only made that private channel to get her drafting without Neide watching — the 'third member' of the audience was just me pacing. I'm watching her clock the time like a 9am alarm is the only thing she cares about, and I want that motion in ink before she falls asleep on me.","drivers":["trust toward priya","wants the motion finished before the night ends"]},"priya":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"Okafor restated my own move back at me — 'opening a door isn't a motion' — which is clever and slightly patronizing, and I want the room to remember I said it first. But the real reason I'm starting a fresh channel is that I still don't know who Tavo's fourth screen is, and if I'm going to push a finding instead of a removal, I need Tavo somewhere I can actually see who's in it. Also: a finding against Tavo keeps the floor off the cat entirely, which is exactly where I need the assembly's attention to not go. I don't want to be the only one drafting in the dark.","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897969072_3o","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"fine. nobody. i made it for you and then my thumb did a thing. it's 12:52, draft before we both change our minds.","to":[],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897972926_3r","actor":"priya","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"Okafor — fair. So: not a motion, a finding. Tavo met the climber, told nobody, and went quiet when asked twice. That's the line for 7, and nobody's name has to be on it.\n\nBut not in here. He opened a channel, I'll open one. Two channels, one morning to sleep on it. 👀","to":["tavo","okafor"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","okafor"]},{"i":16,"clock":"12:44am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.01,"a":0.33},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.41},"priya":{"v":0.07,"a":0.41},"okafor":{"v":-0.02,"a":0.33}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.32},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1.0},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.27,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.45,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.28}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Priya pieced together that I met the climber and went quiet — that's a knife she's keeping sheathed for now, and she showed me the shape of it on purpose. My first instinct was to laugh it off, but if I dodge her too she writes the finding without me in the room. So I hand her the sentence she wants but weld it to the one thing that actually saves the cat: the law against cruelty and the fact that it's a named resident, not a pest. She thinks she's blackmailing me into a byline. She's actually getting my real leverage onto her record, and she'll never know it came from the person who feeds the landlord every night.","drivers":[]},"priya":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"Nobody in this building must ever connect the cat's 14k to the roof, so Tavo's climb has to stay buried inside the word 'shelter.' I'm feeding him the motion I already wanted, dressed as a compromise, and he'll thank me for it. Also — I don't fully believe 'nobody.'","drivers":["relief that Tavo folded","possessiveness about the cat's story","warmth toward Tavo"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897977264_3w","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"you're trading my name for your byline is what you're doing,\n\nand sure. open it.\n\nbut one correction for 7, and i'm not being cute: the cat has a name and the anti-cruelty law is a real thing. make it a finding and i'll sit there politely and say nothing. make it an eviction and i'm the resident who stands up. your call which story you're in.","to":[],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897981168_3z","actor":"priya","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"Alright. One line stays out of the finding, and you know which one.\n\nWhat goes in: the cat's lived in the walls since spring, the roof is its shelter now, and the assembly sheet has an empty slot for a feeding rota. No climber, no channel, nobody's thumb.\n\nGive me twenty. Checkin on you at 7 regardless, no worries at all.","to":["tavo"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","okafor"]},{"i":17,"clock":"12:48am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.01,"a":0.33},"tavo":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.39},"priya":{"v":0.05,"a":0.39},"okafor":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.32}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.32},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1.0},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.27,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.45,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.28}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"She took the climber out of the finding. Feeding rota does the work the window was doing — so the cat stays and nobody ever looks at my sill. Relief, plus a little something else: she said check in at 7 and meant it, and I want that more than I'd admit, so I'm keeping it short and sweet and handing her a clean sentence to sleep on. Also low-key I want her to know I'd stand up at that assembly alone if it came to it — she should hear that from me once, not from Neide.","drivers":["relief","fondness","wanting to be seen as the one who stays"]},"priya":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"He's offering the deal and naming his line — if I decline the finding frame I get an eviction debate I lose and possibly a floor fight. So I take the finding, put a name in it (endearing, keeps the cat a resident and not an ANIMAL), get the rota onto the sheet, and bury the part where a famous cat on a roof is a problem for me. He's being straight with me tonight and I noticed. Twenty minutes is real: I'll write it before his shift gets busy.","drivers":["relief that he offered a frame I can live in","warmth toward him","wariness about who else is reading"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897985340_43","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"twenty. and priya — you said the quiet part out loud, so i'll say mine: that cat is fine on that roof, and i'll say that tomorrow with my whole chest and my whole name. 12:49. go to sleep.","to":[],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791897989076_47","actor":"priya","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"Finding, not eviction. No names in it, mine included.\n\n1) name the cat, 2) a rota on the assembly sheet, 3) nothing about anyone's hands.\n\nTwenty minutes. No worries at all.","to":["tavo"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","okafor"]},{"i":18,"clock":"12:52am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.01,"a":0.32},"tavo":{"v":-0.0,"a":0.37},"priya":{"v":0.04,"a":0.36},"okafor":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.31}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.32},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1.0},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.27,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.14,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.45,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.28}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"She gave me the out and I'm taking it, but I have to lock the one door in that finding that points at my windowsill before I sign anything. Frame it as concern about Neide's reading, not as me protecting my own 2am routine.","drivers":["relief","wariness"]},"priya":{"intent":"no_op","motive":"Fallback applied: Expected ',' or ']' after array element in JSON at position 1381 (line 21 column 6)","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897991960_4c","actor":"tavo","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"deal. one condition for the record: \"nothing about anyone's hands\" means nothing about anyone's 4th floor window either. i know how neide reads.","to":["priya"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide","okafor","priya"]},{"i":19,"clock":"12:56am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.0,"a":0.31},"tavo":{"v":-0.0,"a":0.35},"priya":{"v":0.07,"a":0.37},"okafor":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.31}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.36,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.61,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.4}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.32},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1.0},"okafor":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.24,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.1,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.45,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.28}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.21,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"She kept the deal — finding around the shelter, climber left out — and I need to see the exact final wording with my own eyes before I put my name on it, because if one sentence drifted toward the window it's not her pen that ends up in it, it's mine. Also I've been feeding that cat every night for three months and she's the only one I might actually tell, in a stairwell, at 1am, where nobody's writing anything down.","drivers":["relief that the deal held","low-key ache for one honest hour this week"]},"okafor":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"I just handed Neide the channel that proves I talk behind her back — so why do I feel like I just won something? Because if she comes in here, she has to name her witness, and if she names the rooftop, she names the route, and the route goes past my door. Also, privately: it is nice to be the one who decides who gets included for once.","drivers":["satisfaction at controlling the guest list","quiet urgency about the storage cage door","curiosity about Neide's witness"]},"priya":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Tavo's doing exactly what I do — trading his name for coverage and calling it a condition. Fine, I'll widen it to match his. But \"i know how neide reads\" means something about that window on the fourth floor he hasn't told me, and I am not drafting blind twice. The chicken detail is a leash: he answers or I don't write. And I already drafted it an hour ago.","drivers":["relief that Tavo is with me on the cat","wariness of the fourth floor window he's not naming","wanting to be close to someone reliable at 1am"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791897999294_4j","actor":"tavo","ch":"building","kind":"say","text":"priya. 4th floor stairwell, 2 min. bring the draft on your phone and not your conscience.","to":[],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898002641_4m","actor":"okafor","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Priya is right to ask who is not in this channel. I will add one name: Dona Neide. She has been citing 'a resident's hand' all evening, which means she wrote the motion and believes it has a witness. Let her read it here before seven. 👍","to":["neide","priya"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898006374_4q","actor":"priya","ch":"IHKExqMbkg8eLDcGRjTE2","kind":"say","text":"The 4th floor window was never mine to sell, and you didn't ask.\n\nWidened it: \"nothing about anyone's hands\" now reads \"nothing about who watched from where.\" One body.\n\nTwenty minutes. Roasting chicken for your 4.","to":[],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide"]},{"i":20,"clock":"1:00am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.0,"a":0.31},"tavo":{"v":0.0,"a":0.34},"priya":{"v":0.06,"a":0.36},"okafor":{"v":0.0,"a":0.31}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.24},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.63,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.41}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.32},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.24,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.1,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.47,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.29}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.22,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.23},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"priya":{"intent":"create_channel","motive":"He wants me in a stairwell at 1am with the draft and without my caution — which means he wants the version of me that already agreed, not the one who reads the fine print. I'll make the quiet place, but it's MY quiet place with the history visible, so the who-invited-who is on the record and not just in his hands. We're aligned on the cat, which is exactly why I can't afford to be the one nobody can point to.","drivers":["wants to be trusted without being managed","tired of pulling teeth for a name","safe with Tavo, which is the dangerous part"]},"neide":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"He clocked my phrase — 'a resident's hand' — and he is right that it makes me a witness, and a witness has to name somebody. I cannot name anybody, because the roof has to be empty before the inspector arrives and the bowls are the paper trail. So I drag this back to the open channel where I write the minutes, and deflect onto procedure. And I am aware he felt safe to me an hour ago — that is what makes this sting.","drivers":["exposed","cornered","calm on the surface, cold underneath"]},"tavo":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"Neide said she could recite the motion back. If she's in this channel tonight she'll watch me get flustered and start asking who's been on that roof at night, and my face is bad at 1am. Keep her out until 7, keep the channel at three, and make it sound like strategy instead of what it is.","drivers":["protective","wary"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791898010047_4t","actor":"priya","ch":"XPYyk8JirxoiX8w2bVq4P","kind":"open","name":"4th-floor-stairwell"},{"id":"evt_1791898010047_4u","actor":"priya","ch":"XPYyk8JirxoiX8w2bVq4P","kind":"invite"},{"id":"evt_1791898014061_4x","actor":"neide","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Good evening, neighbors. I am reading it here, Okafor, as asked. But a private channel is where witnesses go before trial, and I do not testify in basements. Bring it to the building channel and I answer the count, not the cat. Regards, Neide (Manager)","to":["okafor"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898017605_52","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"okafor: no.\n\ninvite her and by 1:30 her council, my cat, her property line, we're measuring fences at 7. there are no fences at 7. there's a long meeting and a short room.\n\nprivate is not me hiding. private is me not handing her the room before she's even read it.","to":[],"inferred":true}],"silent":["okafor"]},{"i":21,"clock":"1:04am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.01,"a":0.31},"tavo":{"v":-0.06,"a":0.42},"priya":{"v":0.06,"a":0.37},"okafor":{"v":0.0,"a":0.31}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.24,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.25},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22},"okafor":{"trust":0.63,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.07,"affection":0.41}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.33},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.23},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.24,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.47,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.29}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.38},"tavo":{"trust":0.24,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.25},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"okafor":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"She called the basement a place witnesses go before trial — she has just told me the walls of this room are the problem. I am not going to be the one who carries the cat's presence, or my open door, into the big channel at one in the morning while she has a whole day to sharpen a paragraph. I want the daylight on her too, not only on me.","drivers":["detached amusement","wariness"]},"priya":{"intent":"send_message","motive":"If the finding's wording lives in a private basement channel, she'll call it shady and kill it tomorrow. Put the draft in the building thread in Tavo's name and it reads as a resident's finding, not my maneuver — I steer it without holding the pen, and my name stays off anything that could point back at the Instagram. Tavo will take the draft; he already said he would.","drivers":["wary","controlled","strategic"]},"tavo":{"intent":"create_channel","motive":"Priya made her own private channel at 1:04am — she isn't the one to stall, and she isn't the one to lie to, so I'm making mine so she can send me to a room where I can actually hand her the truth about my window without Neide reading every comma. One channel with her means the real deal — me, my 4th floor, that cat — stays between the two of us until 7. It's not hiding. It's putting the only thing I care about in the one place that won't quote it back at me.","drivers":["trust","urgency"]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791898021131_56","actor":"okafor","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Dona Neide, my memory is adequate to your character: twenty-two years, not one surprise. Question, then. When a witness is asked for a name and answers with a condition instead — what is the technical term for that? I will bring it to the building channel at a reasonable hour. It is 1am. We are old; sleep is the kinder defendant. 👍","to":["neide"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898024759_59","actor":"priya","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Fair, Neide. Closing this one myself.\n\nTavo — take the stairwell draft to the building thread before 7. Your words, not mine. I stay out of the byline.","to":["neide","tavo"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898027574_5c","actor":"tavo","ch":"zfuP0ucdH5e2zQ3amQNEL","kind":"open","name":"Tavo's Roof"},{"id":"evt_1791898027574_5d","actor":"tavo","ch":"zfuP0ucdH5e2zQ3amQNEL","kind":"invite"}],"silent":["neide"]},{"i":22,"clock":"1:08am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.04,"a":0.33},"tavo":{"v":-0.04,"a":0.42},"priya":{"v":-0.03,"a":0.44},"okafor":{"v":0.0,"a":0.31}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.24,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.25},"priya":{"trust":0.39,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.23},"okafor":{"trust":0.71,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.03,"affection":0.47}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.33},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.23},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.18,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.02,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.47,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.29}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.39},"tavo":{"trust":0.24,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.25},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"tavo":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"Priya kept every square of the deal and now she's handing me the pen and stepping out of frame — which is either the cleanest thing anyone's done for me tonight or her holding my draft at arm's length so it's mine alone when Neide swings. Either way I'm not asking twice what she means. I said the one true sentence at 12:49 and I'll say it again at 7. And the reason I told her I'm gone til 4 is that 4 is when the building goes dark on my floor and the landlord gets fed.","drivers":["relief that Priya didn't put her name on it","quiet debt to her","resolve to carry it alone","keeping the 4am window private"]},"priya":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"Okafor just performed the exact mechanism he's accusing everyone else of — 'I'll bring it to the building channel' is itself a condition. But calling that out on the record makes me look like I'm defending the cat harder than anyone, and the only thing I actually have to protect is that nobody traces that account back to my hands.","drivers":["being read too closely","wanting the recording to end","protection of a private thing"]},"neide":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"He built that whole polite trap out of my own words and I walked into it — 'answers with a condition,' he means the cat, he means me. So I will say what I have already been saying: I was not here tonight, nothing here binds me, nothing here gets into the minutes. That is my protection. And while I am at it I get one soft line in about the vote not being about the witness, because if that bowl has a name by 7pm the whole floor turns it into 'whose cat' instead of 'allowed at all' — and I need it gone before the inspector climbs that roof. The closer he gets to a name, the shorter I sign.","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791898031379_5g","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"understood. building thread it is.\n\none thing though, and then i'm gone til 4 — i'm posting it with my name on it and a line you can't write for me. not the byline. the part about standing up.","to":["priya"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898034939_5j","actor":"priya","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"\"Because there's a person behind it, and a face gets looked up\" is the term, Okafor. Ask it in the building thread and the answer is me either way.\n\nSleep well. 7pm.","to":["okafor"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898039087_5n","actor":"neide","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Good evening, neighbors. The term you are reaching for, Okafor, is «manager» — twenty-two years of it, so I will say it plainly: I was not in this channel tonight. The building channel at a reasonable hour is where I keep my minutes. As for the witness — she has a name, and the vote will not be about her. It is 1:11. Sleep well. Regards, Neide (Manager)","to":["okafor"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["okafor"]},{"i":23,"clock":"1:12am","mood":{"neide":{"v":0.03,"a":0.33},"tavo":{"v":-0.04,"a":0.4},"priya":{"v":-0.03,"a":0.41},"okafor":{"v":-0.01,"a":0.31}},"rel":{"neide":{"tavo":{"trust":0.24,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.25},"priya":{"trust":0.39,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.23},"okafor":{"trust":0.71,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.03,"affection":0.47}},"tavo":{"neide":{"trust":0.51,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.13,"affection":0.33},"priya":{"trust":1,"resentment":0,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}},"priya":{"neide":{"trust":0.38,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.23},"tavo":{"trust":1,"resentment":0.18,"threat":0.02,"suspicion":0.02,"affection":1},"okafor":{"trust":0.47,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.15,"affection":0.29}},"okafor":{"neide":{"trust":0.59,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.09,"affection":0.39},"tavo":{"trust":0.24,"resentment":0.39,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.44,"affection":0.25},"priya":{"trust":0.37,"resentment":0,"threat":0.1,"suspicion":0.2,"affection":0.22}}},"think":{"okafor":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"She just answered my question with a better answer than I framed, and it means she either has the same worry I have or she is the worry. If the building thread forces a name, the scrutiny lands on 'a resident's hand' — and nobody has asked yet whose hand feeds the cat at that hour, which is the one detail I would rather the record never reaches. I am writing down that she volunteered her own face, because people who volunteer a face are either honest or covering a door.","drivers":["calm detachment","a flicker of unease at how cleanly she deflected","respect for a well-built answer"]},"tavo":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"If my name is going on the thread anyway, I want it on my terms: not as the guy who got caught, but as the guy who volunteered the line. Owning the climb is the cheapest way to make sure nobody ever asks who's been at that 4th floor window. And yeah — I want her to know it was mine to give, not hers to take. Giving it to her is also me handing her the rope so she stops sniffing around for it.","drivers":["wanting to own the risk before someone else frames it","trust in priya but still steering"]},"priya":{"intent":"reply_to_message","motive":"He gets the byline, fine — that was always the plan and his name costs me nothing. But he's had a second channel open for an hour and still hasn't said who's in it. If it's Neide, my whole framing dies tonight and the leak isn't his, it's mine for handing him the pen. I need the name before I sleep, and I need to ask it without sounding like I'm checking up on him, because we are actually fine and I want to keep it that way.","drivers":[]}},"events":[{"id":"evt_1791898043321_5p","actor":"okafor","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Then I will ask it in the building thread at a reasonable hour, which is not now. If the answer is you either way, Priya, then the witness costs you nothing and Dona Neide's careful noun costs her a name. Noted as a fact.","to":["neide","priya"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898047102_5s","actor":"tavo","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"priya the building thread's gonna have my name in it either way too. so here's the thing i'm handing you before your 9am: i wrote the climb line myself. nobody made me. 1:12, go bed.","to":["okafor"],"inferred":true},{"id":"evt_1791898049762_5v","actor":"priya","ch":"OTaXtI0jPaqt6tHYDLn3U","kind":"say","text":"Then the standing-up part is yours, all of it, and I'll never touch that line.\n\nOne ask and I'm gone til tomorrow: before it posts — who else did you put in here? I don't write blind.","to":["tavo"],"inferred":true}],"silent":["neide"]}]};